  "summary": "Install-time host reconnaissance beacon to oast.fun (Interactsh) callback",
  "details": "setup.py overrides the egg_info command to execute automatically during `pip install`. The overridden command collects the installer's hostname, current working directory, and OS username, URL-encodes them, and sends them via an HTTP GET request to a hardcoded Interactsh out-of-band callback subdomain at fpvbsifkklbmklusmxby2405wa7x7x5bf.oast.fun. This fires on default install without user interaction and leaks installer host identifiers to an attacker-controlled OOB server, consistent with a dependency-confusion reconnaissance beacon.",
